# Production review analysis configuration

- List every implemented production review analysis in the repository-root `ainetreview.json`, even when a project may choose to disable it. Keep this list synchronized when registering or removing production analyses.
- Analysis entries support `enabled` as a boolean and default to `true`; do not add analyses that suppress or hide findings from later audits.
